27786      title 'Introductory Main-Effects ANOVA Example';
27787      data a;
27788      input y x1 $ x2 $;
27789      datalines;

NOTE: The data set WORK.A has 12 observations and 3 variables.

27802      ;
27803      * Fit a main-effects ANOVA model with 1, 0, -1 coding;
27804      proc transreg ss2;
27805      model identity(y) = class(x1 x2 / effects);
27806      output coefficients replace;
27807      run;

NOTE: The data set WORK.DATA36 has 14 observations and 9 variables.
NOTE: The PROCEDURE TRANSREG printed page 1712.

27808      * Display TRANSREG output data set;
